<description>&lt;p&gt;Communal clashes in Lakes state, especially Rumbek, have intensified, prompting a curfew and the return of caretaker governor Rin Tueny, while UNMISS has stepped up civilian protection after deadly violence there. Two SSPDF soldiers were wounded in an attack on a Mundri West military outpost and the U.S. Embassy condemned an assault on WFP workers in Jonglei that involved looting of aid. An AIC cleric was shot dead in Juba and a Juba High Court sentenced five officers to 24 years for raiding a general's home. The lethal communal violence now far exceeds the two battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE9kYlNndzJYenhBdHZVNW9zSmRuYkNySDhFZ2t3NzFLYjRaaUwxXzdIZm1HaC1vWEtqNUpYM3NmdTRNdFZ4bWZLSWZKXzByZHQzNC14ZWYxS2hyU0ZURW8wSVJhVW43aG9WNTVTVXhTSXJwZnk1SW00dTZB0gF_QVVfeXFMUGxhcFd6OGVZekNZQ1JHc3RMQk4tMDFpUVhMaENJRkxpbmlpQm9DM3hUSjE1VkRRYWtPeTNvbVFPUXpMbjVDSHlvc3NyZjZBQ001RGZCSGppeW1LcmtGM0o2OWhTZFk1VTloeWRWUjVfdFNkc21sZmFObjdJZUtjRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxOTzV4TDJ2WUhwUEdhSi1DV2c1RkRSa2ZzV05DWXpzcjh3ZncwQ2w4ay1neloySU81WUxxX2owb1VNQXBPWXhHbWtBcXc3aDd0dUI0T0JWRUoyaHhWYmY5bWcwTFFrWXV5SFFKMFEwSnhNSWw5bWNIQVAzVE5SM081T3RxTXNYMkVXTkRUSldMU1VBWnlnbExOOExrX2lkVXNmSnd0V0JWdloyLUtiMTRoSw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africanews English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africa.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiREFVX3lxTFBZV2l2WWEwN0hJeEVwNkVsaE9iVGFJZDY2VnAxQXRWbEI3Z0pzWWJnV195My0tbTZUN0ZtWE9FYnhaQXJi0gF